## IMPORTANT UX / EDGE CASES

Please make the app handle these properly:

Face enrollment:

* No face detected
* More than one face detected
* Exactly one face
* Camera permission denied
* Enrollment success
* Re-enrollment

Attendance:

* No enrolled face
* No face detected
* Multiple faces
* Face mismatch
* Face match
* Camera permission denied
* Location permission denied
* Successful attendance
* Failed attendance

Attendance should only be saved AFTER successful face verification.

The app should not crash if permissions are denied.

